cwen Financial Corporation and changed its name to Onity Group Inc. in June 2024. Onity Group Inc. was founded in 1988 and is headquartered in West Palm Beach, Florida.","ceo_bio":"Mr. Glen A. Messina | CEO, President & Chair of the Board | Age 63 | Compensation: $3.1M (FY2025)","culture_narrative":"Employs approximately 4K people. Revenue per employee of $267K ranks in the bottom quartile among Financial Services peers, improving at 6%/yr \u2014 growing workforce leverage. Stock-based compensation of $2K per employee reflects an ownership culture. CEO compensation is 12\u00d7 revenue per employee (reasonable relative to workforce productivity). Governance score flags low compensation governance risk (3/10).","financial_summary":["Onity Group Inc. is a micro-cap financial services business with a $259M market cap on $1.1B of annual revenue.","The top line has compounded at +4% over the past three years and -5% annually across the full decade, which puts it in mature, slow-growth territory.","Returns on capital run at 96% against a 10% cost of capital \u2014 a 86-point spread that is the clearest signature of an economic moat.","The company is burning through $751M of cash, and without positive owner earnings any valuation rests on hope rather than evidence.","On the balance sheet, the balance sheet carries net cash, which is the gold standard: the business never has to make desperate decisions in a bad year, and thin 1.2\u00d7 interest coverage leaves no room for a bad year.","Shareholder yield is only 0.0%, a thin return of capital, and insiders hold 18% of the shares, so management thinks like owners because it is one \u2014 the strongest alignment there is."],"sector_headwinds":[{"text":"Piotroski score 3/9 \u2014 the fundamentals are deteriorating on multiple fronts","sev":"red","cat":"quality"},{"text":"Altman Z in the distress zone (0.2) \u2014 the kind of balance-sheet risk that can make a loss permanent","sev":"red","cat":"quality"},{"text":"Low reinvestment-driven growth suggests the compounding engine has stalled","sev":"amber","cat":"growth"},{"text":"Carries a 68% premium to sector median EV/EBITDA","sev":"amber","cat":"valuation","magnitude":0.6787515462936529},{"text":"Volatile returns on capital suggest the moat is narrower than a snapshot ROIC implies","sev":"amber","cat":"moat"},{"text":"Above-average short interest at 5.8% of float","sev":"amber","cat":"sentiment"},{"text":"Financial quality metrics lag Financial Services peers","sev":"amber","cat":"quality"},{"text":"Above-average market volatility (VIX 26)","sev":"amber","cat":"macro"},{"text":"Late-cycle dynamics increase the probability of a slowdown","sev":"amber","cat":"macro"},{"text":"Interest rate regime shifts \u2014 a rapid move in rates can invert the yield curve, crush bond portfolios, and trigger deposit flight simultaneously.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"}],"sector_tailwinds":["ROIC sits in the top quartile of Financial Services peers \u2014 the moat is wider than the neighbourhood"],"news_headlines":[{"title":"Onity Group Inc (ONIT) (Q3 2026) Earnings Call Highlights: Adjusted Pre-Tax Income Doubles to ...","source":"finance.yahoo.com","link":"https://finance.yahoo.com/markets/stocks/articles/onity-group-inc-onit-q3-231919078.html","date":"2026-11-05","timestamp":1793920759.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.103,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":["earnings"]},{"title":"Onity Group (ONIT) Q3 2026 Earnings Call Transcript","source":"fool.com","link":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/05/onity-group-onit-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/?source=iedfolrf0000001","date":"2026-11-05","timestamp":1793905989.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.026,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":["earnings"]},{"title":"Why (ONIT) Price Action Is Critical for Tactical Trading","source":"news.stocktradersdaily.com","link":"https://news.stocktradersdaily.com/news_release/11/Why_ONIT_Price_Action_Is_Critical_for_Tactical_Trading_110526095401_17938